  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Refugee Council (DRC): Mine action - Support to Ukraine recovery through Mine Action Response in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strengthen the long-term reconstruction efforts through mine clearance, risk education and capacity development of the Ukrainian civil society. The project will focus on improving the overall physical safety of conflict-affected communities that have been impacted by explosive ordnance and ensuring that Ukrainian CSO&#x2019;s gain improved skills, knowledge, and tools for planning and carrying out mine action activities.</narrative>
  </description>
